Single Subquery — SQL Practice
Table: employees
emp_id	name	department	salary	experience	city
1	Arun	IT	60000	3	Hyderabad
2	Priya	HR	50000	5	Chennai
3	Rahul	IT	75000	6	Bangalore
4	Sneha	Finance	65000	4	Hyderabad
5	Kiran	HR	45000	2	Mumbai
6	Anjali	IT	80000	8	Chennai
7	Varun	Finance	55000	3	Mumbai
